t-ID and the\nserver replays from the run's buffer.", "originalText": "The browser's EventSource can only send\nGET. The POST saves the message and\nreturns run_id; the GET streams that run.\nIf the connection drops, EventSource\nreconnects with Last-Event-ID and the\nserver replays from the run's buffer.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "b6S"}, {"id": "re00527", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2760, "y": 2632.5, "width": 500, "height": 138.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g00526"], "frameId": "fr00365", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1127777940, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 594759359, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791331688949, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b6T"}, {"id": "te00528", "type": "text", "x": 2778, "y": 2646.5, "width": 136, "height": 25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g00526"], "frameId": "fr00365", "roundness": null, "seed": 2017640874, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 2067611825, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791331688949, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every request", "originalText": "Every request", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "b6U"}, {"id": "te00529", "type": "text", "x": 2778, "y": 2683.5, "width": 321, "height": 63.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g00526"], "frameId": "fr00365", "roundness": null, "seed": 95522